        instruction: { zh: "白棋在A点落子可以救活角上的棋子。但这样一来，白棋也能吃掉标记的三颗黑棋。黑棋无法通过连接B点来救活这些棋子，因为这些棋子仍然处于打吃状态（气不足）。黑棋必须先连接C点，然后白棋才能吃掉这三颗棋子。通过在A点落子，白棋获得三目领地和三颗提子，共六目。如果黑棋在A点落子，角上的白棋被吃，黑棋获得三目领地（角部、B点和C点）。所以黑棋有四目。A点的价值是多少？", en: "White can save the stone in the corner by playing at A. But then, White also catches the three marked stones. Black can not save these stones by connecting at B, because the stones would be still in atari (shortage of liberties). Black has to connect at C first and White can capture the three stones. By playing at A, White gets three points of territory and three captured stones, so six points. If Black plays at A, the white stone in the corner is captured and Black gets three points of territory (corner, B and C). So Black has four points. What is the value of playing at A?" },
